已根据现代 Web 界面设计最佳实践（参考 Apple HIG 及 Material Design 3 的质感原则）对 `login.html` 进行了深度优化。

### 主要优化点：
1.  **视觉层次与深度**：
    *   背景从纯色改为柔和的**径向渐变**，增加空间感。
    *   登录卡片引入**毛玻璃效果 (Backdrop Filter)** 和更细腻的**多层阴影**，使其在背景中自然浮起。
    *   边框采用半透明色，增强通透感。
2.  **交互质感**：
    *   输入框在 Focus 状态下增加了更柔和的光晕扩散。
    *   按钮增加了**微渐变**和**内阴影**，点击时有更真实的物理反馈（缩放 + 阴影变化）。
3.  **排版微调**：
    *   标题使用**文字渐变**效果，提升品牌感。
    *   调整了行高和字间距，使阅读体验更舒适。

以下是优化后的完整代码：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>登录</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            /* 核心色调 - 保持专业且现代 */
            --bg-gradient-start: #f5f7fa;
            --bg-gradient-end: #c3cfe2;
            --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);

            --text-primary: #1d1d1f;
            --text-secondary: #6e6e73;

            --accent-color: #0071e3;
            --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0071e3 0%, #00c6ff 100%);
            --accent-hover: #0077ed;

            --error-color: #ff3b30;
            --border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            --focus-ring: rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.25);

            --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            --shadow-md: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --shadow-lg: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --bg-gradient-start: #0f0c29;
                --bg-gradient-end: #302b63;
                --card-bg: rgba(30, 30, 32, 0.7);
                --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);

                --text-primary: #f5f5f7;
                --text-secondary: #a1a1a6;

                --accent-color: #0a84ff;
                --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a84ff 0%, #5e5ce6 100%);
                --accent-hover: #409cff;

                --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
                --focus-ring: rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.3);

                --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
                --shadow-md: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
                --shadow-lg: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            }
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            /* 优化背景：径向渐变增加中心聚焦感 */
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, var(--bg-gradient-start), var(--bg-gradient-end));
            color: var(--text-primary);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .login-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            /* 毛玻璃效果 */
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            padding: 48px 40px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            /* 多层阴影增加立体感 */
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md), 0 0 0 1px var(--card-border);
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* 鼠标悬停时轻微上浮，增加互动感 */
        .login-container:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg), 0 0 0 1px var(--card-border);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-wrap: balance;
            /* 标题渐变文字效果 */
            background: var(--accent-gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            position: relative;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-left: 4px; /* 对齐输入框内部 */
        }

        input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            font-size: 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); /* 轻微透明背景 */
            color: var(--text-primary);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            input {
                background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            }
        }

        input::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        input:hover {
            border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            input:hover {
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            }
        }

        input:focus-visible {
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--focus-ring), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            background-color: var(--card-bg); /* Focus时变实色以提高可读性 */
        }

        input.error {
            border-color: var(--error-color);
            background-color: rgba(255, 59, 48, 0.05);
        }

        .error-message {
            color: var(--error-color);
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 8px;
            margin-left: 4px;
            display: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .error-message.visible {
            display: block;
            animation: slideDown 0.2s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideDown {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        button[type="submit"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px;
            /* 渐变背景 */
            background: var(--accent-gradient);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            margin-top: 12px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.3);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.4);
            filter: brightness(1.05);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:active {
            transform: scale(0.98) translateY(0);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.3);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:focus-visible {
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--focus-ring), 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 113, 227, 0.3);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:disabled {
            opacity: 0.7;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
            box-shadow: none;
            filter: grayscale(0.2);
        }

        .spinner {
            display: none;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            border-top-color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
            position: absolute;
            right: 16px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
        }

        button[type="submit"].loading .spinner {
            display: block;
        }

        button[type="submit"].loading {
            color: transparent; /* 隐藏文字但保留位置 */
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(360deg); }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            * {
                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
            }
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 32px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        /* 链接下划线动画效果 */
        .footer-links a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 100%;
            transform: scaleX(0);
            height: 1px;
            bottom: -2px;
            left: 0;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            transform-origin: bottom right;
            transition: transform 0.25s ease-out;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover::after {
            transform: scaleX(1);
            transform-origin: bottom left;
        }

        .footer-links a:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
            outline-offset: 4px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="login-container">
        <h1>欢迎回来</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">请输入您的账号信息以继续</p>

        <form id="loginForm" novalidate>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="email">电子邮箱</label>
                <input 
                    type="email" 
                    id="email" 
                    name="email" 
                    autocomplete="username" 
                    spellcheck="false"
                    placeholder="name@example.com"
                    required
                    aria-describedby="email-error"
                >
                <div id="email-error" class="error-message" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="password">密码</label>
                <input 
                    type="password" 
                    id="password" 
                    name="password" 
                    autocomplete="current-password" 
                    placeholder="请输入密码"
                    required
                    aria-describedby="password-error"
                >
                <div id="password-error" class="error-message" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" id="submitBtn">
                登录
                <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="/forgot-password">忘记密码？</a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        const form = document.getElementById('loginForm');
        const emailInput = document.getElementById('email');
        const passwordInput = document.getElementById('password');
        const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submitBtn');

        function showError(input, message) {
            const errorDiv = document.getElementById(input.id + '-error');
            input.classList.add('error');
            input.setAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');
            errorDiv.textContent = message;
            errorDiv.classList.add('visible');
        }

        function clearError(input) {
            const errorDiv = document.getElementById(input.id + '-error');
            input.classList.remove('error');
            input.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');
            errorDiv.textContent = '';
            errorDiv.classList.remove('visible');
        }

        function validateEmail(email) {
            return /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email);
        }

        form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();

            // Clear previous errors
            clearError(emailInput);
            clearError(passwordInput);

            let hasError = false;

            if (!emailInput.value) {
                showError(emailInput, '请输入电子邮箱地址');
                hasError = true;
            } else if (!validateEmail(emailInput.value)) {
                showError(emailInput, '请输入有效的电子邮箱地址');
                hasError = true;
            }

            if (!passwordInput.value) {
                showError(passwordInput, '请输入密码');
                hasError = true;
            }

            if (hasError) {
                // Focus first error field
                const firstError = form.querySelector('[aria-invalid="true"]');
                if (firstError) firstError.focus();
                return;
            }

            // Simulate login request
            submitBtn.disabled = true;
            submitBtn.classList.add('loading');
            submitBtn.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');

            try {
                await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 2000));
                // Success handling would go here
                alert('登录成功！');
            } catch (error) {
                showError(emailInput, '登录失败，请重试');
            } finally {
                submitBtn.disabled = false;
                submitBtn.classList.remove('loading');
                submitBtn.removeAttribute('aria-busy');
            }
        });

        // Real-time validation clearing
        emailInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
            if (emailInput.classList.contains('error')) clearError(emailInput);
        });

        passwordInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
            if (passwordInput.classList.contains('error')) clearError(passwordInput);
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

